		body: '## Installation\n\nThe emoji picker parts ship with the kit in `packages/ui/src/components/emoji-picker.tsx` and the files beside it. Its data comes from `emojibase`, already installed.\n\n```showcase-example\nc-emoji-picker-1\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n\tEmojiPicker,\n\tEmojiPickerCategories,\n\tEmojiPickerContent,\n\tEmojiPickerFooter,\n\tEmojiPickerHeader,\n\tEmojiPickerList,\n\tEmojiPickerPreview,\n\tEmojiPickerSearch,\n\tEmojiPickerSkinTone,\n\tEmojiPickerTrigger,\n} from "@workspace/ui/components/emoji-picker";\n```\n\n```tsx\n<EmojiPicker value={null} onEmojiSelect={({ value }) => insert(value)}>\n\t<EmojiPickerTrigger />\n\t<EmojiPickerContent>\n\t\t<EmojiPickerHeader>\n\t\t\t<EmojiPickerSearch />\n\t\t</EmojiPickerHeader>\n\t\t<EmojiPickerCategories />\n\t\t<EmojiPickerList />\n\t\t<EmojiPickerFooter>\n\t\t\t<EmojiPickerPreview />\n\t\t\t<EmojiPickerSkinTone />\n\t\t</EmojiPickerFooter>\n\t</EmojiPickerContent>\n</EmojiPicker>\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Chat composer\n\n```showcase-example\nc-emoji-picker-2\n```\n\n### Message reactions\n\n```showcase-example\nc-emoji-picker-3\n```\n\n### Page icon\n\n```showcase-example\nc-emoji-picker-4\n```\n\n### Custom team emoji\n\n```showcase-example\nc-emoji-picker-5\n```\n\n### Shortcode suggestions\n\n```showcase-example\nc-emoji-picker-6\n```\n\n## API Reference\n\n```showcase-api\n\n```\n\n## Keyboard\n\n| Key             | Action                                    |\n| :-------------- | :---------------------------------------- |\n| Typing          | Searches, with focus in the search field. |\n| `↑` `↓` `←` `→` | Moves through the grid.                   |\n| `Enter`         | Picks the highlighted emoji.              |\n| `Esc`           | Closes the popover.                       |\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- Focus stays in the search field while the arrow keys move the highlight through the grid, which is exposed as the active option.\n- Each emoji is named; the category tabs and the skin-tone chooser are keyboard-operable.',
